# parse/lstr (id 70): string literal builder. Packs characters into a new heap string at SH = X4,
# 3 units per word (X0 SACC accumulator, X1 SK position, X2 SL length, X3 SW words written).
# PC 1 inside the string, PC 2 just after a quote ("" is a literal quote; anything else ends it),
# PC 3 header write. RDOK = 0 in PC 1 or 2 fetches char I first (after a word write).
